Package: altiro
Type: Package
Title: Analysis of Latent Transcriptional Induction and Response Outcomes
Version: 0.6.1
Authors@R:
    person(given = "J. Sebastián", family = "Contreras-Riquelme",
           email = "contrerasriquelme.sebastian@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: ALTIRO classifies orthologs (between species) or genes (within a species)
    into primed, shared, unique, opposite and no-response expression models
    from five differential-expression contrasts between two groups (species,
    genotypes or cell lines) measured under control and stress conditions. The
    default rules reproduce the decision tree of Contreras-Riquelme et al. (2025)
    <doi:10.1371/journal.pone.0324724>; optional rules treat missing statistics
    explicitly, require a basal difference for primed calls, or replace
    "not significantly different" by a formal equivalence test. Includes helpers
    for reciprocal best BLAST hits and ortholog-level count matrices.
